			<div class="content" id="post-content-3699465">
									

<p>Well, the Circus is in this one, so I'm pretty much contractually obligated to upvote. It's an obligation I'm happy to fulfill, though—the weird anatomical descriptions have some really nice imagery, and his creation backstory is refreshingly blasé. Throwing the Circus into the mix was a risky move, but you've pulled it off in a way that serves to reveal some interesting things about both Mr. PGiBFYH and the Circus itself. Nice nice.</p>
<p>The only thing that's not really jiving for me is the photo. <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">I don't like his face</span> It feels weirdly casual and doesn't really add anything to the article. It's just Some Dude. It detracts from the whimsy of the article, and maybe that's the idea, but I think the interview would have landed harder if you'd maintained a whimsical atmosphere up to that point.</p>
<p><span style="font-size:50%;">Also, after the snorting dominoes bit I was a little disappointed you didn't go for an 8 ball joke, but that might've been too on-the-nose.</span></p>
<p>Side note, I've been gone for a while and&#8230;. <em>holy heck.</em> How many of these things <em>are</em> there? It seems like we've got more weedmisters than wondermisters at this point.</p>

